[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    198[0m:[38;5;10m[49m // Row 7 — negative `bs->pos`: `pos >> 3` is arithmetic, so the read happens
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    199[0m:[38;5;10m[49m //         *before* `bs->buf`.
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    200[0m:[38;5;10m[49m //
